      {
        "id": "book003-b000587-p000-c9811c6139",
        "language": "classical_chinese",
        "content_type": "prose",
        "action": "rewrite",
        "modern_text": "大龙脉结穴时，若周围的小砂众多，如同祥云捧月一般，众砂虽小，但大砂为尊。当大龙脉来到头部结穴，形成三四百步的地面，地势方正，旁边有大砂重重交绕，节节包承，如同祥云捧月之状。若众砂皆小，则特取大龙脉入首结穴，形成二三百步的地面，或方或圆，旁边有小砂如星如月，耸肩开翘，如飞如舞，双双砂头向内朝向明堂，顾盼局势，如同群雁宾鸿之势。",
        "confidence": "high",
        "uncertainty": []
      },
      {
        "id": "book003-b000588-p000-4fdba87976",
        "language": "classical_chinese",
        "content_type": "prose",
        "action": "rewrite",
        "modern_text": "赖氏说：结穴的龙脉特别大，而众砂特别小的情况，必须在大砂之外，又有大砂或长或方，关拦于左右前后之外，包承群砂在内，则局内的水方有归东，不致散乱分流漏泄。否则，砂虽整齐，但水神涣散，能泄堂局之气，纵结穴也不美。若中砂细小而护砂大，其水自有兜收，虽出身轻微，而其力反而重。",
        "confidence": "high",
        "uncertainty": []
      },
      {
        "id": "book003-b000589-p000-59c160165f",
        "language": "classical_chinese",
        "content_type": "prose",
        "action": "rewrite",
        "modern_text": "粗脉出细脉，细脉出粗脉，形状奇特如鹤膝；横脉取曲脉，曲脉取横脉，袅袅如芦花。",
        "confidence": "high",
        "uncertainty": []
      },
      {
        "id": "book003-b000590-p000-f73bfa8132",
        "language": "classical_chinese",
        "content_type": "prose",
        "action": "rewrite",
        "modern_text": "粗中出细，细中出粗，形状如鹤膝，三关四锁，入路而见，出自《玉尺经》卷五。",
        "confidence": "high",
        "uncertainty": []
      },
      {
        "id": "book003-b000591-p000-13e35d3c21",
        "language": "classical_chinese",
        "content_type": "prose",
        "action": "rewrite",
        "modern_text": "来者其气清奇，横来曲展，曲来横展，三折四袅，形似芦花入路。而到者其脉活动，龙体真而穴情善，福力大而富贵远矣。",
        "confidence": "high",
        "uncertainty": []
      },
      {
        "id": "book003-b000592-p000-ed586f3d11",
        "language": "classical_chinese",
        "content_type": "prose",
        "action": "rewrite",
        "modern_text": "赖氏说：三关四锁似断不断，如鹤膝也；三折四身似来不来，如芦花也。此言来情之善，龙脉之活，气行之清，皆于此可见。左衿先师独得之妙，发杨曾之所未到处。",
        "confidence": "high",
        "uncertainty": []
      },
      {
        "id": "book003-b000593-p000-23ca64be2b",
        "language": "classical_chinese",
        "content_type": "prose",
        "action": "rewrite",
        "modern_text": "木形冲天，而包节生处方成。",
        "confidence": "high",
        "uncertainty": []
      },
      {
        "id": "book003-b000594-p000-1802693384",
        "language": "classical_chinese",
        "content_type": "prose",
        "action": "rewrite",
        "modern_text": "如倒地木星，形长直而瘦，若无包节，乃为死木，金用处也。必得水合襟之左右，有界水插入肩膊之内，界出门面，方成体制。",
        "confidence": "high",
        "uncertainty": []
      },
      {
        "id": "book003-b000595-p000-241b074e64",
        "language": "classical_chinese",
        "content_type": "prose",
        "action": "rewrite",
        "modern_text": "火炎上，而焰起动处乃见精微。",
        "confidence": "high",
        "uncertainty": []
      },
      {
        "id": "book003-b000596-p000-30a84710cd",
        "language": "classical_chinese",
        "content_type": "prose",
        "action": "rewrite",
        "modern_text": "如火星成形，头尖脚关，若火焰不动，名照天火，无用也。必得尖斜所向之处，界水插过一边，使尖头归堂，方可立穴。",
        "confidence": "high",
        "uncertainty": []
      },
      {
        "id": "book003-b000597-p000-e94f98779b",
        "language": "classical_chinese",
        "content_type": "prose",
        "action": "rewrite",
        "modern_text": "面方正大，挂角留情。",
        "confidence": "high",
        "uncertainty": []
      },
      {
        "id": "book003-b000598-p000-c31a94066e",
        "language": "classical_chinese",
        "content_type": "prose",
        "action": "rewrite",
        "modern_text": "土星方正，其情在角，界水收气，故曰留情挂角。吐出金唇，则生气更完。廖公言土角流金，正此谓。出自卷五十三。",
        "confidence": "high",
        "uncertainty": []
      },
      {
        "id": "book003-b000600-p000-88f7c4ddbf",
        "language": "classical_chinese",
        "content_type": "prose",
        "action": "rewrite",
        "modern_text": "赖氏说：土为五气之尊，中立不倚，其正性也。傍分界水，立穴在中，通受子午卯酉四止之气，为震杂坎兑之局，尤妙。但不宜当局正心取穴，俗云中宫地也，谬甚矣。惟帝皇之都，多有如此取用者，取宅中以御天下，坐坎面离之义，开日月卯酉之门，而四海文明矣。",
        "confidence": "high",
        "uncertainty": []
      },
      {
        "id": "book003-b000601-p000-d10f01f5f8",
        "language": "classical_chinese",
        "content_type": "prose",
        "action": "rewrite",
        "modern_text": "那关头圆开金，取穴。",
        "confidence": "high",
        "uncertainty": []
      },
      {
        "id": "book003-b000602-p000-0eed9453ed",
        "language": "classical_chinese",
        "content_type": "prose",
        "action": "rewrite",
        "modern_text": "金星形体，脚关头圆，须得开口取穴。然异坐实差，坐下不实，名为悬钟金，其气在边，如钟之声，应在边也。",
        "confidence": "high",
        "uncertainty": []
      },
      {
        "id": "book003-b000603-p000-dea23e2df2",
        "language": "classical_chinese",
        "content_type": "prose",
        "action": "rewrite",
        "modern_text": "虽四通八达之区，必有伏元归气之所。",
        "confidence": "high",
        "uncertainty": []
      },
      {
        "id": "book003-b000604-p000-098e010bbe",
        "language": "classical_chinese",
        "content_type": "prose",
        "action": "rewrite",
        "modern_text": "此总言上文砂水须四通八达，分枝散布面去，然其到头必有收拾之处，为伏元归气之根也。",
        "confidence": "high",
        "uncertainty": []
      },
      {
        "id": "book003-b000605-p000-edd044d9a7",
        "language": "classical_chinese",
        "content_type": "prose",
        "action": "rewrite",
        "modern_text": "赖氏说：龙体到头，东西前后旁分枝砂，四通八达而去，似难收拾。至于入首之处，其众砂分出者，登要只只回头，顾祖，或为龙虎抱归左右，或为案狭俯伏在前，或为拦砂回塞水口。其始虽四通八达，出自卷五十四。",
        "confidence": "high",
        "uncertainty": []
      },
      {
        "id": "book003-b000606-p000-a6b1e691d1",
        "language": "classical_chinese",
        "content_type": "prose",
        "action": "rewrite",
        "modern_text": "若与本方无情，及至到头结穴之处，只只不虚收作用，神乃为伏降之气而归东堂局矣。众水会淹，到堂在前在后，或左或右，东穿西渡，南去北来，一似四通八达，无所收拾。然其总括去处，众水群聚合流于城门之口，重砂关寨于下者，见其合不见其去，此亦伏元归气之根，地有神气而融结，穴情始大。",
        "confidence": "high",
        "uncertainty": []
      },
      {
        "id": "book003-b000607-p000-fa96bc9d60",
        "language": "classical_chinese",
        "content_type": "prose",
        "action": "rewrite",
        "modern_text": "来气短，须防腰截；进气长，尤怕直冲。",
        "confidence": "high",
        "uncertainty": []
      }
